<p class="eyebrow" data-copy-en="Character guide" data-copy-zh="角色攻略">Character guide</p>
<h1 data-copy-en="Sophie" data-copy-zh="Sophie">Sophie</h1>
<p class="starter-description" data-copy-en="Find Sophie, follow her safe introduction and work route, and plan personal visits and gifts." data-copy-zh="找到 Sophie，按顺序推进初遇与工作路线，安排个人拜访和赠礼。">Find Sophie, follow her safe introduction and work route, and plan personal visits and gifts.</p>
<div class="wiki-source-line"><span data-copy-en="v1.0_BETAx · Updated 8 November 2026" data-copy-zh="v1.0_BETAx · 2026 年 11 月 8 日更新">v1.0_BETAx · Updated 8 November 2026</span></div></div></section>
<section class="section wiki-reading-section"><div class="container wiki-reading-layout">
<aside class="wiki-toc"><div class="wiki-toc-inner"><button aria-expanded="false" class="wiki-toc-toggle" data-wiki-toc-toggle="" type="button"><span data-copy-en="On this page" data-copy-zh="本页目录">On this page</span><span aria-hidden="true">+</span></button><p class="wiki-toc-heading" data-copy-en="On this page" data-copy-zh="本页目录">On this page</p><div class="wiki-toc-links" data-lang-panel="en" data-wiki-toc-links=""><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-overview">Helping Sophie find a home</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-location">Find the hiding place, then follow her schedule</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-route">Recruitment and later personal visits</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-activities">Ordinary visits, worker content and holidays</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-troubleshooting">Useful checks when something is missing</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-related">Related guides</a></div><div class="wiki-toc-links" data-lang-panel="zh" data-wiki-toc-links="" hidden="" lang="zh-CN"><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-overview">帮助 Sophie 找到归处</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-location">先找藏身处，再按时间拜访</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-route">招募条件与后续拜访</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-activities">日常相处、员工内容与度假</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-troubleshooting">行动不出现时</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-related">相关指南</a></div></div></aside>
<article class="wiki-article"><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-en" data-lang-panel="en" lang="en"><section id="en-overview"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Credits_and_Current_Scope"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Additional_Shared_Guild_Events"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="NPC_Intimacy_Gallery"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Shared_Island_Encounters"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Sunset_Walk_with_Sophie"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Sunset_Walk_Answers"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Sirena_Isle_Activities"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Home_Scenes"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Bazaar_Date"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Ordinary_Relationship_Menu"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Recruitment_from_the_Hiding_Spot"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Quick_Stats"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Overview"></span><h2>Helping Sophie find a home</h2><figure class="reviewed-screenshot" style="max-width: 256px"><a aria-label="View full screenshot: Sophie — character portrait." href="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/sophie.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="Sophie — character portrait." decoding="async" height="175" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/sophie.webp" width="175"/></a><figcaption>Sophie — character portrait.</figcaption></figure><p>Meet Sophie behind the crates near the Medieval Bazaar. Earn her trust through small acts of kindness, then invite her to the Rose &amp; Thorn. Her later content includes a Bazaar Date, home encounters, worker training, crafted upgrades and island holidays.</p></section>
<section id="en-location"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Schedule_after_Recruitment"></span><h2>Find the hiding place, then follow her schedule</h2><p>From the <strong>Central Plaza</strong>, go to the <strong>Performance Stage → Backstage → Back Street → Dead End → Look Behind Boxes</strong>. These local travel actions cost no time. Use the daytime route, <strong>06:00–20:59</strong>, while the stage and backstage are open. Start with the hiding-place action list; her ordinary portrait appears after recruitment.</p><p>After recruitment, keep <strong>worker 2 active and home from vacation</strong>. Her ordinary portrait follows this daily schedule:</p><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Portrait location</th><th scope="col">Daily hours</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Central Plaza</th><td data-label="Daily hours">09:00–13:59</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Worker Quarters</th><td data-label="Daily hours">15:00–17:59</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Courtyard</th><td data-label="Daily hours">19:00–22:59</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Her assigned worker shift, initially <strong>12:00–19:59</strong>, is a separate schedule. The hiding-place entrance disappears after recruitment.</p></section>
<section id="en-route"><h2>Recruitment and later personal visits</h2><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Hiding-place action</th><th scope="col">Cost</th><th scope="col">Progress</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Talk to Sophie</th><td data-label="Cost">10 min</td><td data-label="Progress">+1 kindness; no direct affection</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Give Food to Sophie</th><td data-label="Cost">10 min; 1 Food</td><td data-label="Progress">+1 kindness; +1 direct affection</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Give Coin to Sophie</th><td data-label="Cost">10 min; $10</td><td data-label="Progress">+1 kindness; +1 direct affection</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Invite to Rose &amp; Thorn</th><td data-label="Cost">120 min</td><td data-label="Progress">One-time recruitment after the full checklist</td></tr></tbody></table><p>To reveal and use the invitation, own the establishment, reach <strong>Known (25)</strong> with Sophie, make at least <strong>ten kindness actions</strong> at her hiding place, and complete all three encounters below. Talk counts as kindness but grants no direct affection; food and coins build both. Each of the three encounters is automatic and happens once, without requiring Sophie to be recruited first.</p><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Kindness encounter</th><th scope="col">Where / start</th><th scope="col">Other relationship</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">The Kind Fox</th><td data-label="Where / start">Food Vendors；06:00–20:59</td><td data-label="Other relationship">Kalb：Acknowledged (10)</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">A Warm Gift</th><td data-label="Where / start">Crafts and Jewelry Stall；06:00–20:59</td><td data-label="Other relationship">Rose Arthur：Acknowledged (10)</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Secret Kindness</th><td data-label="Where / start">Central Plaza；06:00–20:59</td><td data-label="Other relationship">Jade：Acknowledged (10)</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Keep participating characters home from vacation. Once the checklist is complete, return to the hiding place and choose <strong>Invite to Rose &amp; Thorn</strong>. The 120-minute scene recruits worker 2; there is no additional recruitment fee.</p><p>Afterward, <strong>Bazaar Date</strong> starts from her plaza portrait at <strong>Acquaintance (50),09:00–13:59</strong>. It takes <strong>120 minutes, $75 and 40 Energy</strong>, once. Her other home visits are independent opportunities rather than a single mandatory romance sequence. Listed workers must be active; participants subject to vacation checks must be home.</p><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">One-time visit</th><th scope="col">Where / start</th><th scope="col">Requirements</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Welcome to the Establishment</th><td data-label="Where / start">Elara's Office；10:00–14:59</td><td data-label="Requirements">Active: Sophie</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Old Archives</th><td data-label="Where / start">Elara's Office；Open hours</td><td data-label="Requirements">Sophie：Friend (100)；Elara：Friend (100)；Active: Elara, Sophie</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Courtyard Quiet</th><td data-label="Where / start">Courtyard；19:00–22:59</td><td data-label="Requirements">Sophie：Close Friend (200)；Active: Sophie</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Fernando follow-up</th><td data-label="Where / start">Tailor Shop；08:00–17:59</td><td data-label="Requirements">Sophie：Acknowledged (10)；Fernando：Acknowledged (10)；Active: Sophie</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Small Kindnesses Remembered</th><td data-label="Where / start">General Goods Store；08:00–17:59</td><td data-label="Requirements">Sophie：Acknowledged (10)；Hailey：Acknowledged (10)；Active: Sophie</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Pet Bunny</th><td data-label="Where / start">Worker Quarters；13:00–17:59</td><td data-label="Requirements">Pepper：Known (25)；Sophie：Known (25)；Active: Pepper, Sophie</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Awkward Massage</th><td data-label="Where / start">Nurse's Room；10:00–15:59</td><td data-label="Requirements">Sophie：Acknowledged (10)；Willow：Acknowledged (10)；Elara：Acknowledged (10)；Active: Sophie, Willow, Elara</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Finding Family</th><td data-label="Where / start">Worker Quarters；11:00–16:59</td><td data-label="Requirements">Sophie：Acknowledged (10)；Jade：Acknowledged (10)；Honey：Acknowledged (10)；Active: Sophie, Jade, Honey</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Girls' Day Out</th><td data-label="Where / start">Central Plaza；10:00–16:59</td><td data-label="Requirements">Sophie：Acknowledged (10)；Jade：Acknowledged (10)；Active: Sophie, Jade</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Grace Under Scrutiny</th><td data-label="Where / start">Worker Quarters；Open hours</td><td data-label="Requirements">Active: Sophie；Esperanza’s first establishment visit completed</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">A Night with Sophie</th><td data-label="Where / start">Master Bedroom；21:00–23:59</td><td data-label="Requirements">Sophie：550 affection；Active: Sophie</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Lost Pet Situation</th><td data-label="Where / start">Central Plaza；08:00–17:59</td><td data-label="Requirements">Sophie：Acknowledged (10)；Shadow：Known (25)；Hailey：Known (25)；Active: Sophie</td></tr></tbody></table><p>A later guild visit occurs in the <strong>Hidden Chamber</strong> with <strong>Thieves Guild reputation 230, Sophie at Friend (100), and worker 2 active</strong>. It is also needed for her third crafted upgrade; discover the scene itself in play.</p></section>
<section id="en-activities"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Christmas_Gift_with_Jade"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Worker_Visits_and_Training"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Crafted_Gifts_and_Permanent_Training_Upgrades"></span><h2>Ordinary visits, worker content and holidays</h2><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Action</th><th scope="col">Location / requirement</th><th scope="col">Cost / allowance</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Talk to Sophie</th><td data-label="Location / requirement">Any normal portrait</td><td data-label="Cost / allowance">15 min; 1 base affection; twenty/day shared across locations</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Compliment Sophie</th><td data-label="Location / requirement">Central Plaza；Acquaintance (50)</td><td data-label="Cost / allowance">20 min; 2 base affection; twenty/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Give Chocolate to Sophie</th><td data-label="Location / requirement">Central Plaza；Known (25)</td><td data-label="Cost / allowance">15 min; 1 Chocolate; 3 base affection; twenty/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Street Wisdom</th><td data-label="Location / requirement">Worker Quarters；Known (25)；Communication 50</td><td data-label="Cost / allowance">30 min; +1 Intelligence and 10 direct affection; once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Private Moment</th><td data-label="Location / requirement">Worker Quarters；800 affection</td><td data-label="Cost / allowance">30 min; 20 Energy; 50 base affection; once/day</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Preferred stats: <strong>Charm 30, Intelligence 30 and Cooking 30</strong>. Her favorite gift is Chocolate; learned <strong>Pleasure Arts</strong> improves affection gains. <strong>A Night with Sophie</strong> needs 550 affection and a visit to the Master Bedroom at 21:00–23:59. <strong>Private Moment</strong> separately needs 800 affection and her afternoon Worker Quarters portrait; completing one does not replace the other.</p><p><strong>Reassure Sophie</strong> appears on her Worker Quarters or Courtyard portrait: <strong>20 minutes,1 base affection and +1 Loyalty up to 100,once daily</strong>, independently of Talk and worker visits.</p><p>For ordinary <strong>Visit Worker</strong>, start during her assigned shift while she is active, healthy, home and not resting. Base entry costs <strong>60 minutes,60 Energy and 40 Calm</strong>; each day allows one session with Talk, Praise, a gift and training. Training unlocks eight options in sequence. See the Brothel guides for stat rewards, clothing, stress and room upgrades.</p><p>At <strong>In Love (3000)</strong>, bring the matching crafted gift to the correct portrait for each upgrade below. Each completes once, costs <strong>0 additional minutes</strong>, and consumes exactly one gift. They improve their matching training and add <strong>+50% each</strong> to her income multiplier (all three:2.5×).</p><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">One-time upgrade</th><th scope="col">Portrait / earlier milestone</th><th scope="col">Crafted gift consumed</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">The Woman in the Glass</th><td data-label="Portrait / earlier milestone">Central Plaza；09:00–13:59；Bazaar Date</td><td data-label="Crafted gift consumed">Abyssal Looking Glass</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Mine to Give</th><td data-label="Portrait / earlier milestone">Worker Quarters；15:00–17:59；A Night with Sophie</td><td data-label="Crafted gift consumed">Moonfang Leather Choker</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Nothing Left to Hide</th><td data-label="Portrait / earlier milestone">Courtyard；19:00–22:59；Courtyard Quiet；later guild milestone complete</td><td data-label="Crafted gift consumed">Hexbound Rose Sachet</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Eligible Soul Stone bonding also appears in her Worker Quarters menu when its own requirements are met. Use the Soul Stones guide for bonding rules.</p><h3>Sirena Isle</h3><p>Send Sophie on vacation and select her island portrait. Her home activities move out of reach while she is away. These daily activities have their own allowances:</p><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Activity</th><th scope="col">Where / start</th><th scope="col">Cost and allowance</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Talk</th><td data-label="Where / start">Selected island portrait</td><td data-label="Cost and allowance">15 min; six/day; 1 base affection</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Relax</th><td data-label="Where / start">Sirena Isle Beach；08:00–15:59</td><td data-label="Cost and allowance">60 min; once/day; +50 Energy</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Eat Together</th><td data-label="Where / start">Sirena Isle Buffet；11:00–15:59</td><td data-label="Cost and allowance">60 min; once/day; Satiation set to 100</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Spa Night</th><td data-label="Where / start">Sirena Isle Spa；19:00–22:59</td><td data-label="Cost and allowance">60 min; once/day; +25 Health, Energy and Calm</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Sunset Walk</th><td data-label="Where / start">Sirena Isle Beach；17:00–19:59</td><td data-label="Cost and allowance">60 min; once/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Private Beach Time</th><td data-label="Where / start">Sirena Isle Beach；10:00–17:59</td><td data-label="Cost and allowance">60 min; once/day; 50 base affection</td></tr></tbody></table><p>She also has the following one-time shared island encounters. All listed worker participants must be active and vacationing together. Shelly and Uhura are island residents; only Sophie needs a vacation for those two visits.</p><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Other participant(s)</th><th scope="col">Meet at</th><th scope="col">Start</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Elara</th><td data-label="Meet at">Sirena Isle Buffet</td><td data-label="Start">11:00–15:59</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Honey</th><td data-label="Meet at">Sirena Isle Buffet</td><td data-label="Start">11:00–15:59</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Sandra</th><td data-label="Meet at">Sirena Isle Beach</td><td data-label="Start">17:00–19:59</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Grace</th><td data-label="Meet at">Sirena Isle Spa</td><td data-label="Start">19:00–22:59</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Raven</th><td data-label="Meet at">Sirena Isle Buffet</td><td data-label="Start">11:00–15:59</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Shadow</th><td data-label="Meet at">Sirena Isle Beach</td><td data-label="Start">17:00–19:59</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Valkyra</th><td data-label="Meet at">Sirena Isle Beach</td><td data-label="Start">17:00–19:59</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Ava and Eva</th><td data-label="Meet at">Sirena Isle Buffet</td><td data-label="Start">11:00–15:59</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Jade</th><td data-label="Meet at">Sirena Isle Buffet</td><td data-label="Start">11:00–15:59</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Brandy</th><td data-label="Meet at">Sirena Isle Beach</td><td data-label="Start">17:00–19:59</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Willow</th><td data-label="Meet at">Sirena Isle Spa</td><td data-label="Start">19:00–22:59</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Vixen</th><td data-label="Meet at">Sirena Isle Beach</td><td data-label="Start">08:00–15:59</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Kasumi</th><td data-label="Meet at">Sirena Isle Spa</td><td data-label="Start">19:00–22:59</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Audrey</th><td data-label="Meet at">Sirena Isle Beach</td><td data-label="Start">08:00–15:59</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Momosagi</th><td data-label="Meet at">Sirena Isle Spa</td><td data-label="Start">19:00–22:59</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Maize</th><td data-label="Meet at">Sirena Isle Buffet</td><td data-label="Start">11:00–15:59</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Pepper</th><td data-label="Meet at">Sirena Isle Spa</td><td data-label="Start">19:00–22:59</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Shadow, Jade</th><td data-label="Meet at">Sirena Isle Buffet</td><td data-label="Start">11:00–15:59</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Grace, Audrey</th><td data-label="Meet at">Sirena Isle Beach</td><td data-label="Start">08:00–15:59</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Shelly</th><td data-label="Meet at">Sirena Isle Gift Shop</td><td data-label="Start">08:00–20:59</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Uhura</th><td data-label="Meet at">Sirena Isle Entrance</td><td data-label="Start">08:00–20:59</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Vespa</th><td data-label="Meet at">Sirena Isle Beach</td><td data-label="Start">08:00–15:59</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Vespa, Audrey</th><td data-label="Meet at">Sirena Isle Beach</td><td data-label="Start">08:00–15:59</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Cinnamon</th><td data-label="Meet at">Sirena Isle Buffet</td><td data-label="Start">11:00–15:59；after Cinnamon’s A Room to Perform</td></tr></tbody></table><p>For the seasonal <strong>Jade and Sophie’s Gift</strong>, activate Christmas Spirit and use the <strong>Master Bedroom location menu,18:00–22:59 or 00:00–02:59</strong>. Sophie and Jade must both be at <strong>Crush (400)</strong> and active as workers 2 and 15. The paid-content visit takes <strong>30 minutes</strong>, completes once awards 15 direct affection to each of Sophie and Jade, and advances Holly’s task 12.</p><p>Her three NPC intimacy gallery rewards unlock at <strong>100,250 and 500 NPC intimacy experience</strong>. Worker training, Private Moment, island Private Beach Time and Sunset Walk contribute to that separate total. Ordinary affection is not gallery experience.</p><p>Affection figures are base values before favorite-stat and learned-skill bonuses. Ordinary affection sets the relationship stage; each activity still has its own prerequisites. Listed time windows are start times; their ending hour is excluded.</p></section>
<section id="en-troubleshooting"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Troubleshooting"></span><h2>Useful checks when something is missing</h2><ul><li>No pre-recruitment portrait at the plaza: follow the stage/backstage route and use the hiding-place action list.</li><li>Ten talks alone do not provide Known affection. Add food or coins, and finish the Kalb, Rose Arthur and Jade encounters.</li><li>After recruitment, check active-worker status, her three portrait windows and vacation plans. Her work shift is separate.</li><li>Private Moment requires 800 affection at 15:00–17:59; the Master Bedroom visit instead needs 550 affection at 21:00–23:59.</li><li>For a crafted upgrade, check In Love, the exact gift, the correct portrait and the listed completed scenes. The third also needs the later guild milestone.</li><li>For shared visits, check every participant’s relationship, active-worker and vacation requirements.</li><li>Use the Master Bedroom location menu for the Christmas gift, and enable Christmas Spirit.</li></ul></section>
<section id="en-related"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Related_Pages"></span><h2>Related guides</h2><ul><li><a href="game-systems-brothel.html">Rose &amp; Thorn — workers, shifts and training</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-brothel-stats-and-calculations.html">Brothel calculations — training and income</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-thieves-guild.html">Thieves Guild — reputation progression</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-sirena-isle-resort.html">Sirena Isle — vacation planning</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-soul-stones.html">Soul Stones — bonding rules</a></li><li><a href="character-holly.html">Holly — Christmas activities</a></li><li><a href="character-fernando.html">Fernando — clothing</a></li><li><a href="character-rose-arthur.html">Rose Arthur — crafted gifts</a></li><li><a href="character-ben-arthur.html">Ben Arthur — crafted gifts</a></li><li><a href="character-silas.html">Silas — crafted gifts</a></li></ul></section>
</div><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-zh" data-lang-panel="zh" hidden="" lang="zh-CN"><section id="zh-overview"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Credits_and_Current_Scope"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Additional_Shared_Guild_Events"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-NPC_Intimacy_Gallery"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Shared_Island_Encounters"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Sunset_Walk_with_Sophie"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Sunset_Walk_Answers"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Sirena_Isle_Activities"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Home_Scenes"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Bazaar_Date"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Ordinary_Relationship_Menu"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Recruitment_from_the_Hiding_Spot"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Quick_Stats"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Overview"></span><h2>帮助 Sophie 找到归处</h2><figure class="reviewed-screenshot" style="max-width: 256px"><a aria-label="查看完整截图：Sophie 的角色头像。" href="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/sophie.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="Sophie 的角色头像。" decoding="async" height="175" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/sophie.webp" width="175"/></a><figcaption>Sophie 的角色头像。</figcaption></figure><p>Sophie 在中世纪集市附近的木箱后。先用小小的善意获得她的信任，再邀请她到玫瑰与荆棘。之后还有集市约会、家中相处、员工训练、制作礼物升级和海岛度假。</p></section>
<section id="zh-location"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Schedule_after_Recruitment"></span><h2>先找藏身处，再按时间拜访</h2><p>从<strong>中央广场</strong>依次前往<strong>表演舞台 → 后台 → 后街 → 死胡同 → 查看箱子后面</strong>。这些区域内移动不消耗时间；建议在舞台与后台开放的<strong>06:00–20:59</strong>前往。初期使用藏身处的行动列表，招募后才会出现普通人物头像。</p><p>招募后，需要<strong>员工 2 保持在职，且没有外出度假</strong>。她每天的普通头像时间如下：</p><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">头像地点</th><th scope="col">每天时段</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">中央广场</th><td data-label="每天时段">09:00–13:59</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">员工宿舍</th><td data-label="每天时段">15:00–17:59</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">庭院</th><td data-label="每天时段">19:00–22:59</td></tr></tbody></table><p>员工工作班次是另一套时间，初始为<strong>12:00–19:59</strong>。招募完成后，藏身处入口会消失。</p></section>
<section id="zh-route"><h2>招募条件与后续拜访</h2><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">藏身处行动</th><th scope="col">消耗</th><th scope="col">作用</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">与Sophie交谈</th><td data-label="消耗">10 分钟</td><td data-label="作用">善意次数 +1；不直接增加好感</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">送Sophie食物</th><td data-label="消耗">10 分钟；1 食物</td><td data-label="作用">善意次数 +1；直接好感 +1</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">送Sophie硬币</th><td data-label="消耗">10 分钟；10 财富</td><td data-label="作用">善意次数 +1；直接好感 +1</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">邀请加入玫瑰与荆棘</th><td data-label="消耗">120 分钟</td><td data-label="作用">条件齐全后招募；一次</td></tr></tbody></table><p>邀请需要：拥有店铺、Sophie 达到<strong>已知（Known，25）</strong>、在藏身处进行至少<strong>十次善意行动</strong>，并完成下面三段剧情。交谈算善意次数，但不直接给好感；食物与零钱两者都会增加。三段剧情都是自动、一次性的，不要求先招募 Sophie。</p><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">善意剧情</th><th scope="col">地点／开始时段</th><th scope="col">其他关系要求</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">善良的狐狸</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">食物摊贩；06:00–20:59</td><td data-label="其他关系要求">Kalb：已遇见（Acknowledged，10）</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">温暖的礼物</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">工艺品与珠宝摊；06:00–20:59</td><td data-label="其他关系要求">Rose Arthur：已遇见（Acknowledged，10）</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">秘密的善意</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">中央广场；06:00–20:59</td><td data-label="其他关系要求">Jade：已遇见（Acknowledged，10）</td></tr></tbody></table><p>有度假条件的参加者要留在家中。条件齐全后回藏身处选择<strong>「邀请到玫瑰与荆棘」</strong>；剧情消耗 120 分钟，招募员工 2，没有额外招募费。</p><p>之后达到<strong>相识（Acquaintance，50）</strong>，即可从<strong>09:00–13:59</strong>的广场头像发起<strong>「集市约会」</strong>：<strong>120 分钟、75 财富、40 精力</strong>，仅一次。其他家中拜访是各自独立的机会，不必当成一条固定顺序的恋爱任务。表中指定员工须保持在职，有度假条件的参加者须在家。</p><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">一次性拜访</th><th scope="col">地点／开始时段</th><th scope="col">条件</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">欢迎来到店里</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">Elara 的办公室；10:00–14:59</td><td data-label="条件">在职：Sophie</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">旧档案馆</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">Elara 的办公室；开放时段</td><td data-label="条件">Sophie：朋友（Friend，100）；Elara：朋友（Friend，100）；在职：Elara, Sophie</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">庭院静夜</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">庭院；19:00–22:59</td><td data-label="条件">Sophie：亲密朋友（Close Friend，200）；在职：Sophie</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Fernando 的后续会面</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">裁缝店；08:00–17:59</td><td data-label="条件">Sophie：已遇见（Acknowledged，10）；Fernando：已遇见（Acknowledged，10）；在职：Sophie</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">被铭记的小小善意</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">杂货店；08:00–17:59</td><td data-label="条件">Sophie：已遇见（Acknowledged，10）；Hailey：已遇见（Acknowledged，10）；在职：Sophie</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">宠物兔兔</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">员工宿舍；13:00–17:59</td><td data-label="条件">Pepper：已知（Known，25）；Sophie：已知（Known，25）；在职：Pepper, Sophie</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">尴尬的按摩</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">护士室；10:00–15:59</td><td data-label="条件">Sophie：已遇见（Acknowledged，10）；Willow：已遇见（Acknowledged，10）；Elara：已遇见（Acknowledged，10）；在职：Sophie, Willow, Elara</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">找到家人</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">员工宿舍；11:00–16:59</td><td data-label="条件">Sophie：已遇见（Acknowledged，10）；Jade：已遇见（Acknowledged，10）；Honey：已遇见（Acknowledged，10）；在职：Sophie, Jade, Honey</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">姐妹休闲日</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">中央广场；10:00–16:59</td><td data-label="条件">Sophie：已遇见（Acknowledged，10）；Jade：已遇见（Acknowledged，10）；在职：Sophie, Jade</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">审视下的优雅</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">员工宿舍；开放时段</td><td data-label="条件">在职：Sophie；先完成 Esperanza 初次来访</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">与Sophie共度一夜</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">主卧；21:00–23:59</td><td data-label="条件">Sophie：550 好感；在职：Sophie</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">走失宠物事件</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">中央广场；08:00–17:59</td><td data-label="条件">Sophie：已遇见（Acknowledged，10）；Shadow：已知（Known，25）；Hailey：已知（Known，25）；在职：Sophie</td></tr></tbody></table><p>另有一次后期公会拜访：到<strong>隐藏密室</strong>，需要<strong>盗贼公会声望 230、Sophie 为朋友（Friend，100），且员工 2 在职</strong>。这也是她第三项制作礼物升级的条件，剧情内容留待亲自体验。</p></section>
<section id="zh-activities"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Christmas_Gift_with_Jade"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Worker_Visits_and_Training"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Crafted_Gifts_and_Permanent_Training_Upgrades"></span><h2>日常相处、员工内容与度假</h2><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">行动</th><th scope="col">地点／条件</th><th scope="col">消耗／次数</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">与Sophie交谈</th><td data-label="地点／条件">任一普通头像</td><td data-label="消耗／次数">15 分钟；1 点基础好感；每天二十次，三处共用</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">赞美Sophie</th><td data-label="地点／条件">中央广场；相识（Acquaintance，50）</td><td data-label="消耗／次数">20 分钟；2 点基础好感；每天二十次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">送巧克力给Sophie</th><td data-label="地点／条件">中央广场；已知（Known，25）</td><td data-label="消耗／次数">15 分钟；1 巧克力；3 点基础好感；每天二十次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">街头智慧</th><td data-label="地点／条件">员工宿舍；已知（Known，25）；沟通 50</td><td data-label="消耗／次数">30 分钟；智力 +1、10 点直接好感；一次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">私人时刻</th><td data-label="地点／条件">员工宿舍；800 好感</td><td data-label="消耗／次数">30 分钟；20 精力；50 点基础好感；每天一次</td></tr></tbody></table><p>她偏好的属性是<strong>魅力 30、智力 30、烹饪 30</strong>，最喜欢巧克力，学会<strong>愉悦技巧</strong>也能提高好感收益。<strong>「与 Sophie 共度一夜」</strong>需要 550 好感，并在 21:00–23:59 进入主卧；<strong>「私人时刻」</strong>则另需 800 好感，从下午员工宿舍的头像发起，两者不能互相替代。</p><p>在员工宿舍或庭院的头像还能选择<strong>「安慰 Sophie」</strong>：<strong>20 分钟、1 点基础好感、忠诚度 +1（最高 100）</strong>，每天一次，与交谈和员工拜访分别计算。</p><p>普通<strong>「拜访员工」</strong>要在她的工作班次内进行，并保持在职、健康、在家且没有休息。基础入场消耗<strong>60 分钟、60 精力、40 镇定</strong>；每天一次，可在同一场拜访中交谈、夸奖、送礼和训练。训练依次开放八项，属性收益、服装、压力和房间升级见青楼系统指南。</p><p>到<strong>恋爱中（In Love，3000）</strong>后，带上对应制作礼物，在指定头像选择升级。每项只完成一次，<strong>不另花时间</strong>，消耗恰好一个礼物；强化对应训练，并分别为收入倍率增加<strong>50%</strong>，三项全齐为<strong>2.5 倍</strong>。</p><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">一次性升级</th><th scope="col">头像／先完成的节点</th><th scope="col">消耗的制作礼物</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">镜中女人</th><td data-label="头像／先完成的节点">中央广场；09:00–13:59；集市约会</td><td data-label="消耗的制作礼物">深渊魔镜</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">由我决定给予</th><td data-label="头像／先完成的节点">员工宿舍；15:00–17:59；与Sophie共度一夜</td><td data-label="消耗的制作礼物">月牙皮颈圈</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">再无隐藏</th><td data-label="头像／先完成的节点">庭院；19:00–22:59；庭院静夜；完成后期公会节点</td><td data-label="消耗的制作礼物">咒缚玫瑰香囊</td></tr></tbody></table><p>满足相应条件时，员工宿舍菜单还会出现灵魂石羁绊行动，具体规则见灵魂石指南。</p><h3>塞壬岛</h3><p>安排 Sophie 度假，再选择她的岛上头像。她外出期间无法进行家中活动；岛上日常活动各有独立次数：</p><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">活动</th><th scope="col">地点／开始时段</th><th scope="col">消耗与次数</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">交谈</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">选中的岛上头像</td><td data-label="消耗与次数">15 分钟；每天六次；1 点基础好感</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">海滩休息</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">塞壬岛海滩；08:00–15:59</td><td data-label="消耗与次数">60 分钟；每天一次；精力 +50</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">一起用餐</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">塞壬岛自助餐；11:00–15:59</td><td data-label="消耗与次数">60 分钟；每天一次；饱腹感恢复到 100</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">水疗之夜</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">塞壬岛水疗馆；19:00–22:59</td><td data-label="消耗与次数">60 分钟；每天一次；生命、精力、镇定各 +25</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">日落散步</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">塞壬岛海滩；17:00–19:59</td><td data-label="消耗与次数">60 分钟；每天一次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">海滩私人时光</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">塞壬岛海滩；10:00–17:59</td><td data-label="消耗与次数">60 分钟；每天一次；50 点基础好感</td></tr></tbody></table><p>下面还有一次性的海岛共同剧情。表中员工须都在职并一同度假；Shelly 与 Uhura 是岛上居民，这两项只需 Sophie 度假。</p><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">其他参加者</th><th scope="col">地点</th><th scope="col">开始时段</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Elara</th><td data-label="地点">塞壬岛自助餐</td><td data-label="开始时段">11:00–15:59</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Honey</th><td data-label="地点">塞壬岛自助餐</td><td data-label="开始时段">11:00–15:59</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Sandra</th><td data-label="地点">塞壬岛海滩</td><td data-label="开始时段">17:00–19:59</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Grace</th><td data-label="地点">塞壬岛水疗馆</td><td data-label="开始时段">19:00–22:59</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Raven</th><td data-label="地点">塞壬岛自助餐</td><td data-label="开始时段">11:00–15:59</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Shadow</th><td data-label="地点">塞壬岛海滩</td><td data-label="开始时段">17:00–19:59</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Valkyra</th><td data-label="地点">塞壬岛海滩</td><td data-label="开始时段">17:00–19:59</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Ava and Eva</th><td data-label="地点">塞壬岛自助餐</td><td data-label="开始时段">11:00–15:59</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Jade</th><td data-label="地点">塞壬岛自助餐</td><td data-label="开始时段">11:00–15:59</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Brandy</th><td data-label="地点">塞壬岛海滩</td><td data-label="开始时段">17:00–19:59</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Willow</th><td data-label="地点">塞壬岛水疗馆</td><td data-label="开始时段">19:00–22:59</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Vixen</th><td data-label="地点">塞壬岛海滩</td><td data-label="开始时段">08:00–15:59</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Kasumi</th><td data-label="地点">塞壬岛水疗馆</td><td data-label="开始时段">19:00–22:59</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Audrey</th><td data-label="地点">塞壬岛海滩</td><td data-label="开始时段">08:00–15:59</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Momosagi</th><td data-label="地点">塞壬岛水疗馆</td><td data-label="开始时段">19:00–22:59</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Maize</th><td data-label="地点">塞壬岛自助餐</td><td data-label="开始时段">11:00–15:59</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Pepper</th><td data-label="地点">塞壬岛水疗馆</td><td data-label="开始时段">19:00–22:59</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Shadow, Jade</th><td data-label="地点">塞壬岛自助餐</td><td data-label="开始时段">11:00–15:59</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Grace, Audrey</th><td data-label="地点">塞壬岛海滩</td><td data-label="开始时段">08:00–15:59</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Shelly</th><td data-label="地点">塞壬岛礼品店</td><td data-label="开始时段">08:00–20:59</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Uhura</th><td data-label="地点">塞壬岛入口</td><td data-label="开始时段">08:00–20:59</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Vespa</th><td data-label="地点">塞壬岛海滩</td><td data-label="开始时段">08:00–15:59</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Vespa, Audrey</th><td data-label="地点">塞壬岛海滩</td><td data-label="开始时段">08:00–15:59</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Cinnamon</th><td data-label="地点">塞壬岛自助餐</td><td data-label="开始时段">11:00–15:59；先完成 Cinnamon 的「一间属于她的表演室」</td></tr></tbody></table><p>季节活动<strong>「Jade 与 Sophie 的礼物」</strong>需要先启用圣诞精神，再于<strong>18:00–22:59 或 00:00–02:59</strong>使用<strong>主卧的地点菜单</strong>。Sophie 与 Jade 都须达到<strong>迷恋（Crush，400）</strong>，员工 2 与 15 保持在职。需付费内容解锁，消耗<strong>30 分钟</strong>，仅一次，为 Sophie、Jade 各增加 15 点直接好感，并推进 Holly 的第 12 项任务。</p><p>她的三张人物亲密画廊奖励分别需要<strong>100、250、500 亲密经验</strong>。员工训练、私人时刻、海滩私人时光及日落散步都能积累这一数值；普通好感不等于画廊经验。</p><p>表中的好感是基础值，会受到偏好属性、已学技能等加成影响。关系阶段取决于普通好感，其他活动的前置条件仍需分别满足。时间范围表示开始行动的时段，结束时间不包含在内。</p></section>
<section id="zh-troubleshooting"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Troubleshooting"></span><h2>行动不出现时</h2><ul><li>招募前广场没有头像：沿舞台、后台路线进入藏身处，用地点行动列表。</li><li>十次交谈本身不能达到已知好感；补充食物或零钱，并完成 Kalb、Rose Arthur、Jade 的三段剧情。</li><li>招募后检查在职状态、三处头像时段，以及是否正在度假；工作班次另算。</li><li>私人时刻看 800 好感与 15:00–17:59；主卧拜访看 550 好感与 21:00–23:59。</li><li>制作礼物升级要同时满足恋爱中、准确礼物、指定头像和前置剧情，第三项还要求后期公会节点。</li><li>共同拜访要逐一检查每位参加者的关系、在职与度假条件。</li><li>圣诞礼物从主卧地点菜单发起，记得启用圣诞精神。</li></ul></section>
